## ✍ turn_002.log
Emmett Grave traced an impossible, otherworldly map within the forsaken crypt of St. Aldric, feeling the living heat beneath the cold stone. The crypt came alive with flickering shadows and eerie whispers as he ventured further, driven by curiosity to uncover Ravenmoor's long-forgotten secrets.

## ✍ turn_003.log
Dorian Ashgrove discovered an ancient incantation during his conversation with Vera Nighthollow at the Aldwick Inn, causing him to feel a growing sense of unease. Meanwhile, Emmett Grave, outside the inn, sensed a strange presence while preparing to confront whatever was hidden beneath the crypt marked by a chalked X.

## ✍ turn_004.log
